[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14522.03, "timestamp": "04:02:02", "text": "陰謀論者安吉爾那樣的音樂。我做的其實就是閒聊。他喜歡閒聊。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14529.58, "timestamp": "04:02:09", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14538.389, "timestamp": "04:02:18", "text": "，喜歡待在公寓裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14546.229, "timestamp": "04:02:26", "text": "。她為什麼總是說"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14552.91, "timestamp": "04:02:32", "text": "知道。你超可愛。這樣你就可以隱藏真實的自己。你不需要炫耀自己。在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14569.74, "timestamp": "04:02:49", "text": "日本，隱私很重要，對吧？匿名性很重要，還有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14572.11, "timestamp": "04:02:52", "text": "[音樂]方面的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14574.87, "timestamp": "04:02:54", "text": "。我喜歡"}]